Description: ShellOS desktop (COSMIC) and everything it ships with
 Pulls in the ShellOS kernel, tuning and boot integration, the COSMIC
 desktop, Intel hybrid-CPU firmware and drivers, the sched_ext LAVD
 scheduler, and the default user environment (zsh + starship, Alacritty,
 Firefox, Flatpak with Flathub, Distrobox).
